<title>FINLAND: CHIPS TO SELL PLASTO TO BRIO.</title>
<headline>CHIPS TO SELL PLASTO TO BRIO.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish potato chip and toy group Ab Chips Oy Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday it would sell its toy unit Ab Plasto Oy Ltd to Sweden's Brio group for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;Chips will sell the entire share capital of Ab Plasto Oy Ltd to Sweden's Brio group,&quot; Chips said.  </p>
<p>Chips said it would from now on concentrate entirely on the food stuffs business.</p>
<p>Plasto has 65 million markka annual net sales, and its profitability has been satisfactory, Chips said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
